---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'

import Me from '@/assets/images/me.jpg'
import { SITE, socialLinks } from '@/lib/site'

import Link from './Link.astro'

const socialLinkClass =
  'group flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground'
---

<div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-12">
  <div class="md:col-span-1">
    <div
      class="size-48 overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-xl md:sticky md:top-12">
      <Image
        src={Me}
        alt="Portrait of Chris Nowicki"
        loading="eager"
        width={384}
        class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale transition-all duration-200 hover:grayscale-0"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="md:col-span-2">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8">
      Thanks for stopping by. Email is the clearest way to contact me about a
      speaking opportunity, developer experience, something I have published, or
      a professional collaboration.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 leading-7">
      A short, specific note is welcome. You do not need a formal introduction;
      a useful subject line and enough context to understand the request are a
      good place to start.
    </p>

    <a
      href={`mailto:${SITE.EMAIL}`}
      class="group border-border bg-muted/30 hover:bg-muted mt-6 block rounded-lg border p-5 transition-colors duration-200">
      <span
        class="text-muted-foreground block font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
        Email
      </span>
      <span
        class="text-foreground mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
        {SITE.EMAIL}
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >→</span
        >
      </span>
    </a>

    <section
      class="border-border mt-10 border-t pt-8"
      aria-labelledby="helpful-details-heading">
      <h2 id="helpful-details-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold">
        Helpful details to include
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-7">
        The most useful context depends on the inquiry. Including the details
        below makes the purpose of your message clear without requiring a long
        email.
      </p>
      <ul
        class="text-muted-foreground marker:text-foreground mt-4 space-y-3 pl-5">
        <li class="list-disc leading-7">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Speaking:</strong> the event, audience,
          format, date, location or time zone, and whether the session will be recorded.
        </li>
        <li class="list-disc leading-7">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Professional collaboration:</strong>
          the goal, the current context, and what you would like me to consider or
          discuss.
        </li>
        <li class="list-disc leading-7">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Published work:</strong> a link to the relevant
          page and the specific idea, question, or correction you are writing about.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section
      class="border-border mt-10 border-t pt-8"
      aria-labelledby="social-heading">
      <h2 id="social-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold">
        Elsewhere online
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-7">
        The public profiles below are another way to follow what I share. For a
        detailed inquiry, email keeps the full context in one place.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {
          socialLinks.map(({ name, icon: Icon, url, label }) => (
            <Link
              href={url}
              class={socialLinkClass}
              target="_blank"
              ariaLabel={label}>
              <Icon
                width={20}
                height={20}
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-110"
              />
              <span class="font-medium">{name}</span>
            </Link>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-8 text-sm leading-6">
      The <a
        href="/privacy"
        class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/40 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4"
        >privacy notice</a
      > explains how this site handles analytics, theme preferences, outbound links,
      and email correspondence.
    </p>

    <span class="font-cursive text-foreground mt-8 block text-4xl">— Chris</span
    >
  </div>
</div>
